OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste collections 'biggest
OL,4,Achange' in years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA West Sussex council has introduced
OL,7,Fweekly food waste collections in a move
OL,8,Fit said is "probably the biggest
OL,9,Fchange" for its waste and recycling
OL,10,Fteam for "many, many years".
OL,12,FEach house in the Crawley borough area
OL,13,Fwill have its food waste collected
OL,14,Fseparately starting Monday, almost six
OL,15,Fmonths after the government's 31 March
OL,16,Fdeadline.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
