OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFood waste collections 'biggest
OL,4,Achange' in years
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Hilton, Crawley Borough Council's
OL,7,F(CBC) cabinet member for the
OL,8,Fenvironment, said the council had spent
OL,9,Ftwo and a half years getting ready so
OL,10,Fit "had all our ducks in a row" before
OL,11,Frollout.
OL,13,FResearch carried out by the BBC earlier
OL,14,Fthis year showed that five out of 13
OL,15,FSussex authorities were going to miss
OL,16,Fthe deadline.
